doc:Factspaper schema:abstract "This paper presents a distributed measurement system intended to monitor the health status of medium-voltage switchgears under varying temperature conditions. Thermocouples are deployed as temperature sensors, and unsupervised learning techniques support health-status evaluation and early fault detection."@en .
